      "exp_st3_h": "Production and Live Tracking",
      "exp_st3_p": "Every work order opens with a serial number; material, WPS, welder and NDT records flow into the portal during production. Any delay risk is visible weeks ahead, not on shipping day.",
      "exp_st4_h": "Documents, Export Paperwork and Shipping",
      "exp_st4_p": "The CE DoP and document file are ready in the portal before dispatch; export paperwork is prepared by ArmaWeld. Loading in Konya for EXW, delivery at your address for DAP.",
      "exp_s4_label": "Who It's For",
      "exp_s4_title": "Which Companies in Europe Do We Work With?",
      "exp_s4_desc": "Manufacturers with their own product who want to source the welded module from a reliable supplier, and contractors who need certified steel structures. Our references include companies from Austria, Germany, Luxembourg and Norway:",
      "exp_sec1_h": "Machine and Equipment Builders",
      "exp_sec1_p": "Frames, bodies, chassis, bases",
