      "exp_sec4_p": "EN 1090 EXC2/EXC3, CE-marked members",
      "exp_sec5_h": "Energy and Process Plants",
      "exp_sec5_p": "Support structures, platforms, pressure lines",
      "exp_sec6_h": "Agricultural Machinery",
      "exp_sec6_p": "Trailer and machine frames, sub-assemblies",
      "exp_s5_label": "Frequently Asked Questions",
      "exp_s5_title": "Questions European Buyers Ask",
      "exp_f1_q": "Can steel structures made in Türkiye be used in the EU with CE marking?",
      "exp_f1_a": "Yes. Members produced under factory production control (FPC) certified by a notified body under EN 1090-1 can be placed on the EU market with a Declaration of Performance (DoP) and CE marking. ArmaWeld's FPC certificate is valid up to EXC3.",
      "exp_f2_q": "In which language are the documents?",
      "exp_f2_a": "Quotation, contract, WPS/WPQR, material certificates, NDT and dimensional reports and the CE Declaration of Performance are issued in English. The customer portal has an English interface.",
      "exp_f3_q": "Which delivery terms do you work with?",
      "exp_f3_a": "Quotes are prepared with EXW Konya and DAP (your delivery address) options. Sea shipments are planned via the port of Mersin; export paperwork is prepared by ArmaWeld.",
      "exp_f4_q": "How do I follow production remotely?",
      "exp_f4_a": "On order confirmation a portal account is opened for your company. The order's position on the 7-stage line, estimated delivery, documents, NDT reports and shipping details are visible 24/7; your purchasing, quality and engineering teams see the same record.",
      "exp_f5_q": "Do you provide data for CBAM (Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism)?",
      "exp_f5_a": "Material origin and EN 10204 3.1 certificates are part of every delivery file. Any additional emission data needed for the CBAM declaration on steel imports into the EU is planned together at the quotation stage. See our CBAM guide for details.",
      "exp_f6_q": "Do you also quote for small batches or prototypes?",
      "exp_f6_a": "Yes. Samples, prototypes and small batches are possible; any minimum quantity is set at the quotation stage according to project requirements. Technical agreement is reached first and series production follows first article approval.",
      "exp_s6_title": "Related Pages for European Buyers",
      "exp_l_portal": "Customer portal: track your order live",
      "exp_l_blog1": "CBAM and steel export guide",
      "exp_l_blog2": "CE marking in welded fabrication",
      "exp_cta_h": "Get a quote from Türkiye for your project in Europe",
      "exp_cta_p": "Send your drawings and we will come back within 48 hours with a quote in English, a welding plan and delivery options.",
      "exp_ld_name": "Contract Manufacturing from Türkiye for Europe",
      "exp_ld_desc": "EN 1090 CE-marked, EN ISO 3834-2 certified welded fabrication for machine builders and contractors in Europe; English document file, EXW/DAP delivery and live tracking in the customer portal.",
      "exp_ld_type": "Export Welded Fabrication",
      "cut_title": "Laser Cutting, CNC Bending and Welding in One Order | Konya, Türkiye — ArmaWeld",
      "cut_meta_desc": "Sheet metal cutting and bending with welding in one order from Konya, Türkiye: laser and plasma cutting, CNC press-brake bending, welding, NDT and assembly. Cutting plan and incoming inspection by ArmaWeld; parts arrive ready to assemble. Get a quote.",
      "cut_og_title": "Laser Cutting, CNC Bending and Welding in One Order | ArmaWeld",
      "cut_breadcrumb": "Cutting and Bending",
      "cut_label": "Cutting + Bending + Welding · One Contract, One Responsibility",
      "cut_h1": "Laser Cutting, CNC Bending<br>and <span>Welding</span> in One Order",
      "cut_lead": "No need to find separate suppliers for cutting and bending. ArmaWeld prepares the cutting plan from your DXF; cutting and bending are done at partner facilities audited to our specification, parts pass our incoming inspection, are welded in-house and delivered ready to assemble.",
      "cut_trust1": "Cutting Plan from DXF",
      "cut_trust2": "Incoming Inspection by ArmaWeld",
      "cut_trust3": "Welding and NDT In-House",
      "cut_trust4": "EN 10204 3.1 Material",
      "cut_cta_fason": "Contract Welding",
      "cut_s1_label": "Scope",
      "cut_s1_title": "From Cutting to Assembly-Ready Parts",
      "cut_s1_desc": "Every step is recorded under the same serial number; one document file is delivered, including operations done at partners.",
      "cut_c1_icon": "Laser",
      "cut_c1_h": "Laser Cutting",
      "cut_c1_p": "Thin and medium-gauge sheet parts, precise contours and holes; cutting plan straight from DXF, weld preparation included.",
      "cut_c2_icon": "Plasma",
      "cut_c2_h": "Plasma and Oxy-Fuel Cutting",
      "cut_c2_p": "CNC plasma and oxy-fuel cutting for thick plates and structural parts; toleranced cutting and weld-edge preparation.",
      "cut_c3_icon": "Bending",
      "cut_c3_h": "CNC Press-Brake Bending",
      "cut_c3_p": "V and U bends with programmed angles and spring-back compensation; angle and dimension checks on receipt at ArmaWeld.",
      "cut_c4_icon": "Rolling",
      "cut_c4_h": "Plate Rolling",
      "cut_c4_p": "Rolling for tank shells, pipes and conical parts; longitudinal seams welded in-house, long seams on the 35 m submerged arc line.",
      "cut_c5_icon": "Welding",
      "cut_c5_h": "Welding and NDT",
      "cut_c5_p": "Cut and bent parts are welded in-house to approved WPS; VT, PT, MT and UT by ISO 9712 Level 2 personnel.",
      "cut_c6_icon": "Assembly",
      "cut_c6_h": "Machining, Painting and Assembly",
      "cut_c6_p": "Post-weld machining and painting in the partner network; mechanical assembly, torque records and site-ready packaging in-house.",
      "cut_s2_label": "Scope",
      "cut_s2_title": "What Is Done Where?",
      "cut_s2_desc": "Critical work is done in-house; the rest at partner facilities we select and audit, to our own specification. ArmaWeld is accountable for the full quality.",
      "cut_r1k": "In-house",
      "cut_r1v": "Engineering, cutting plan, incoming inspection, welding, NDT, assembly, document file",
