      "cut_sec6_p": "Repeatable batches, serial-numbered",
      "cut_s5_label": "Frequently Asked Questions",
      "cut_s5_title": "Cutting and Bending FAQ",
      "cut_f1_q": "Are laser cutting and bending done at ArmaWeld itself?",
      "cut_f1_a": "Cutting and bending are carried out at partner facilities that ArmaWeld selects and audits, to our own specification; the cutting plan, material sourcing and incoming inspection are ArmaWeld's. Welding, NDT and assembly are done in-house, and ArmaWeld is accountable for the quality of the whole chain.",
      "cut_f2_q": "Can I order cutting only or bending only?",
      "cut_f2_a": "Yes, it can be quoted. The real advantage, however, is planning cutting, bending and welding in one order: one price, one lead time and parts ready to assemble.",
      "cut_f3_q": "Which file formats do you accept?",
      "cut_f3_a": "DXF, DWG, STEP and PDF. For parts without drawings, we measure the sample and prepare the shop drawing.",
      "cut_f4_q": "How are bending tolerances checked?",
      "cut_f4_a": "Every bent part is checked for angle and dimensions at ArmaWeld's incoming inspection; readings taken with calibrated instruments are recorded under the serial number. Non-conforming parts are not welded.",
      "cut_f5_q": "What do you need for a quote?",
      "cut_f5_a": "Technical drawing (DXF/DWG/STEP/PDF), material grade and thickness, quantity, required surface treatment and, if any, quality class and NDT requirements. Quote within 48 hours.",
      "cut_s6_title": "Related Pages",
