      "stl_s5_title": "Structural Steel FAQ",
      "stl_f1_q": "What does EN 1090 EXC3 certification mean?",
      "stl_f1_a": "EN 1090-2 is the mandatory production standard for placing steel structural components on the market with CE marking. EXC3 is the execution class for structures in the higher consequence class; ArmaWeld's certificate covers all classes from EXC1 to EXC3.",
      "stl_f2_q": "Do you prepare the structural design?",
      "stl_f2_a": "Production follows the customer's approved structural design and shop drawings. Our mechanical engineers review the shop drawings for manufacturability and weld details and propose weld detail and fixture improvements.",
      "stl_f3_q": "Which documents come with the delivery?",
      "stl_f3_a": "CE Declaration of Performance (DoP), EN 10204 3.1 material certificates, WPS/WPQR, welder certificates, NDT reports, dimensional report and paint or galvanising thickness records. The whole file also stays in the customer portal.",
      "stl_f4_q": "Which surface protection options are available?",
      "stl_f4_a": "ISO 12944 C4–C5 paint systems after Sa 2½ blasting, or hot-dip galvanising. Surface treatment is carried out at partner facilities audited to ArmaWeld's specification; DFT measurements go into the document file.",
      "stl_f5_q": "Do you export structural steel to Europe?",
      "stl_f5_a": "Yes. Our EN 1090 FPC certificate and CE-marked production are suitable for the EU market. We serve export customers with an English document file, EXW or DAP delivery options and live tracking in the customer portal.",
      "stl_s6_title": "Related Pages on Steel Fabrication",
      "stl_l_fason": "Contract welding in Konya",
      "stl_l_blog1": "What is EN 1090 EXC3?",
      "stl_l_blog2": "Structural steel fabrication guide",
      "stl_cta_h": "Let's review your steel structure project together",
      "stl_cta_p": "Send your structural design and shop drawings and receive a quote within 48 hours, including execution class, welding plan and document scope.",
      "stl_ld_name": "Structural Steel Fabrication",
      "stl_ld_desc": "EN 1090-2 EXC3 certified, CE-marked structural steel fabrication in Konya, Türkiye: load-bearing frames, platforms, stairs, roof trusses, equipment bases and energy structures.",
      "stl_ld_type": "Structural Steel Fabrication"
